abstract: "Gemma 4 E2B fine-tuned with LoRA to answer a biomedical research question only from a given abstract, as JSON with a yes, no or maybe label, a short answer and the numbers of the sentences it relied on, scored with EvalKit on all 1,000 expert-labelled PubMedQA questions. Research only, not medical advice."
